# Tessara architecture

- Widgets in `firmware/widgets/` — Widget SDK + UI Kit only; no Arduino/Wi‑Fi/board headers.
- Thin shell: slots, nav, theme; no product logic keyed by widget id.
- Contract: `docs/guides/architecture.md`. Authoring: `docs/guides/widget-authoring.md`.
- Widget settings are namespaced; device settings stay separate.
- Todoist/calendar are outside product MVP acceptance; OK as optional widgets/patterns.
- Do not commit `secrets.h`, `.pio/`, `.venv/`.
